        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Layered sodium silicate, SKS-6, powder, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Layered sodium silicate, SKS-6, powder, at plant
data based on information from the major European producer;
UUID: c3604814-e4ea-34f4-b598-79591fbf1483
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of SKS-6 sodium silicate powder. Transport and infrastructure have been estimated. The input of compressed air is not reported in the data according to the methodology of the study.
Location: data represent production of major producer
Technology: technology from major European producer
Time period: producer information for production year 1997
Production volume: na
Sampling: questionnaire 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c3604814-e4ea-34f4-b598-79591fbf1483.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
